{
  "rc": {
    "_note": "每日费用(2026-09-24):近 30 天每天按 API 标价折算的费用,按模型堆叠(颜色跟模型走,与页面同一套钉槽);横线 = 有用量日子的日均(不含今天),标签放在底行右端(压在柱子上会看不清);底行图例前 4 个模型 + 其他。\n每段的 h / u 与颜色串都由服务端 w.trend.segs 给好。",
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "title": "每日费用",
        "empty": "等待首次同步",
        "d7": "近 7 天 ",
        "vs": "比前 7 天 ",
        "avg": "日均 ",
        "other": "其他"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "title": "Daily cost",
        "empty": "Not synced yet",
        "d7": "7 days ",
        "vs": "Vs prior 7 days ",
        "avg": "Avg ",
        "other": "Other"
      }
    },
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FDFBFA\\,#FBF3F1)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#1A1A1C\\,#221E1F)@90",
        "_note": "每日费用(2026-09-24):近 30 天每天按 API 标价折算的费用,按模型堆叠(颜色跟模型走,与页面同一套钉槽);横线 = 有用量日子的日均(不含今天),标签放在底行右端(压在柱子上会看不清);底行图例前 4 个模型 + 其他。"
      },
      {
        "_note": "源色身份点:本包统一用 Claude 暖橙两档。",
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B"
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "23pt",
        "y": "12pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-94pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.title}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "30pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}*0.5",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.d7}$[findNotEmpty::(${w.trend.d7},--)]",
        "fontSize": "12pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.trend.d7C}),k),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "31pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.vs}${w.trend.d7C}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "$[if::(eq::(${w.trend.d7U},1),#C15F3C|#E8916B,#6B7280|#8E939B)]",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "alignmentH": "2"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "{parent.h}-26pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
        "h": "1pt",
        "bgColor": "#EFE5E1|#2A2522"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "forEach",
        "props": {
          "items": "${w.trend.segs}",
          "key": "_it",
          "index": "_i"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "14pt+${_it.i}*({parent.w}-28pt)/30",
            "y": "{parent.h}-106pt+80pt*${_it.u}",
            "w": "({parent.w}-28pt)/30-3pt",
            "h": "80pt*${_it.h}",
            "bgColor": "${_it.c}"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${w.trend.hasAvg},1),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-106pt+80pt*${w.trend.avgU}",
            "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
            "h": "1pt",
            "bgColor": "#9AA1AC|#5B6270"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-19pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.avg}${w.trend.avgS}",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "alignmentH": "2"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "forEach",
        "props": {
          "items": "${w.trend.legend}",
          "key": "_it",
          "index": "_i"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "14pt+${_it.i}*({parent.w}-82pt)/5",
            "y": "{parent.h}-18.5pt",
            "w": "6pt",
            "h": "6pt",
            "bgColor": "${_it.c}",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "1.5pt",
              "leftB": "1.5pt",
              "rightT": "1.5pt",
              "rightB": "1.5pt"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "22pt+${_it.i}*({parent.w}-82pt)/5",
            "y": "{parent.h}-19pt",
            "w": "({parent.w}-82pt)/5-9pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "$[if::(eq::(${_it.n},Other),${@i18n.other},${_it.n})]",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "时效锚:右上角、与卡名同一基线、9pt、右对齐(卡片设计系统 §3)。",
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "15pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${at},${@i18n.empty})]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentH": "2"
      }
    ]
  }
}